request.description:
Sends invalid data in every field to show that all validation errors come back together, keyed by field name, so the frontend can show each message under its input.

**Expected (400)**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "errors": {
    "name": "Name is required",
    "email": "Please provide a valid email",
    "password": "Password must be 8-72 characters"
  }
}
```

